* Sun Nov 1 2026 Andrea Scarpino <andrea@scarpino.dev> 0.0.15-1
- Device detail page: tap a device in the list to see its MagicDNS
  name, IPv4, IPv6, OS, key expiry and status; tap an address to
  copy it.
- Ping: 10 pings with a live per-bar ms latency graph, direct vs
  relayed (via DERP) connection type, and a Stop button.
- Settings: "Start at boot" — enables the tailscaled service so it
  starts at boot and keeps running after the app closes.
* Sat Oct 31 2026 Andrea Scarpino <andrea@scarpino.dev> 0.0.14-14
- Fix app crash when stopping a running ping or leaving the device
  detail page while a ping is in flight (QProcess::waitForFinished()
  re-enters the finished slot, which had already deleted m_ping;
  cancelPing now re-checks the pointer before use).
- Device detail: remove the back arrow from the page header (SFOS
  edge-swipe still pops the page and cancels a running ping).
* Sat Oct 31 2026 Andrea Scarpino <andrea@scarpino.dev> 0.0.14-13
- Settings: "Start at boot" — enables the tailscaled.service unit
  (systemctl enable) and keeps the daemon running after the app closes.
- Ping: cancel on every exit path (back button, Stop, page destruction,
  app backgrounded) with tagged + timestamped /tmp ping log.
- Ping graph: smaller per-bar ms labels (16px) to stop overlap.
* Mon Oct 26 2026 Andrea Scarpino <andrea@scarpino.dev> 0.0.14-1
- Update tailscale to 1.104.2.
- Add Norwegian translation.
- Translations update.

